REGIONAL REGULATION OF JEMBER REGENCY

NUMBER 4 YEAR 2008

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE JEMBER REGENCY

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF JEMBER,

Considering:

a. that in order to prevent and overcome violence against women and children in Jember Regency so as to avoid violence, threats of violence, torture or treatment that degrades human dignity and honor, services and protection are needed for women and children victims of violence in Jember Regency;
b. that in order for the handling of violence against women and children in Jember Regency to be carried out more effectively and efficiently, it is necessary to regulate the protection of women and children victims of violence in Jember Regency;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence in Jember Regency.

In View of:

1. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1 Year 1946 concerning the Criminal Code;
2. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 12 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Province of East Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 41 Year 1950);
3. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6 Year 1974 concerning Basic Provisions on Social Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1974 Number 53, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3039);
4. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1974 Number 32).
5. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 8 Year 1981 concerning the Criminal Procedure Code (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1981 Number 76);
6. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);
7. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 23 Year 1992 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 100, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3495);
8. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 20 Year 1999 concerning Ratification of International Labour Organization Convention Number 138 concerning Minimum Age for Admission to Employment (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 56, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3835);
9. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
10. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1 Year 2000 concerning Ratification of International Labour Organization Convention Number 182 concerning the Prohibition and Immediate Action for the Elimination of the Worst Forms of Child Labour (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2000 Number 30, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3941);
11. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 26 Year 2000 concerning Human Rights Court (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2000 Number 208, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4026);
12. Police Law Number 2 Year 2002 concerning the State Police of the Republic of Indonesia (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 2, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4168);
13. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3941);
14. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 17 Year 2003 concerning State Finance (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 47, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4286);
15. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1 Year 2004 concerning State Treasury (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 5, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4355);
16. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 10 Year 2004 concerning the Establishment of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 53, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4389);
17. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 23 Year 2004 concerning Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95 Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
18. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 125, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4437), as amended twice most recently by Law Number 12 Year 2008 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2005 Number 108, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4548);
19. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 33 Year 2004 concerning Financial Balance between the Central Government and Regional Governments (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 126, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4438);
20. Government Regulation of the Republic of Indonesia Number 104 Year 2000 concerning Balancing Funds (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2000 Number 201, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4021);
21. Government Regulation of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3 Year 2002 concerning Compensation, Restitution and Rehabilitation for Gross Violations of Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 7, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4172);
